sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant UI as Admin Web
    participant API as Firmware API
    participant FS as Firmware Service
    participant Storage as Firmware Storage
    participant DB as Database
    actor QA
    actor Admin

    Dev->>UI: Upload firmware file + metadata + SHA-256
    UI->>API: POST /api/firmware
    API->>API: Authenticate and check DEVELOPER role
    API->>FS: uploadFirmware(file, metadata, Dev.id)

    FS->>FS: Validate version range (minRequiredVersionCode <= versionCode)
    FS->>DB: Check duplicate (model, versionNo)
    DB-->>FS: Existing count
    FS->>FS: Calculate SHA-256 & validate supported model

    alt Invalid version range, unsupported model, or SHA-256 mismatch
        FS-->>API: Validation failed
        API-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
        UI-->>Dev: Reject upload
    else Duplicate (model, versionNo) already exists
        FS-->>API: Duplicate firmware version
        API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
        UI-->>Dev: Reject duplicate version
    else All upload validations passed
        FS->>Storage: Store firmware file
        Storage-->>FS: Return fileUrl

        FS->>DB: BEGIN; INSERT firmware_versions
        Note right of DB: status = UPLOADED<br/>uploadedBy = Dev.id
        FS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (FIRMWARE_UPLOADED)
        Note right of DB: actorType = MEMBER, actorId = Dev.id
        DB-->>FS: COMMIT transaction

        FS-->>API: Upload successful
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI-->>Dev: Waiting for QA approval
    end

    QA->>UI: Review pending firmware
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/firmware/{id}/approve
    API->>API: Authenticate and check QA role
    API->>FS: approveFirmware(firmwareId, QA.id)
    FS->>DB: SELECT uploadedBy, status FROM firmware_versions
    DB-->>FS: Firmware information

    alt QA is the original uploader (uploadedBy == QA.id)
        FS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (FIRMWARE_APPROVAL_DENIED)
        FS-->>API: Four-eyes rule violation
        API-->>UI: 403 Forbidden (FOUR_EYES_VIOLATION)
        UI-->>QA: Cannot approve own firmware
    else Firmware status is not UPLOADED
        FS-->>API: Invalid firmware state
        API-->>UI: 409 Conflict (INVALID_STATE)
        UI-->>QA: Firmware cannot be approved
    else Four-eyes rule & state satisfied
        FS->>DB: BEGIN; UPDATE firmware_versions
        Note right of DB: status = APPROVED, approvedBy = QA.id<br/>DB CHECK: uploadedBy <> approvedBy
        FS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (FIRMWARE_APPROVED)
        Note right of DB: actorType = MEMBER, actorId = QA.id
        DB-->>FS: COMMIT transaction

        FS-->>API: Approval successful
        API-->>UI: 200 OK
        UI-->>QA: Firmware approved
    end

    Note over API,DB: APPROVED firmware can be selected for campaigns<br/>only after compatibility checks

    opt ADMIN deprecates a faulty firmware
        Admin->>UI: Deprecate firmware
        UI->>API: PATCH /api/firmware/{id}/deprecate
        API->>API: Authenticate and check ADMIN role
        API->>FS: deprecateFirmware(firmwareId, Admin.id)
        FS->>DB: SELECT status FROM firmware_versions
        DB-->>FS: Current firmware status

        alt Firmware is not APPROVED (e.g. UPLOADED or already DEPRECATED)
            FS-->>API: Invalid firmware state
            API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
            UI-->>Admin: Firmware cannot be deprecated
        else Firmware is APPROVED
            FS->>DB: BEGIN; UPDATE firmware_versions SET status = DEPRECATED
            FS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (FIRMWARE_DEPRECATED)
            Note right of DB: actorType = MEMBER, actorId = Admin.id
            DB-->>FS: COMMIT transaction
            FS-->>API: Deprecation successful
            API-->>UI: 200 OK
            UI-->>Admin: Firmware deprecated
        end
    end
